  "annotations": {
    "engagement": "Value is gated by workflow, not by a different technology: all three tiers are RFID. Good provides snapshot reads (handheld); Better adds event reads at fixed control points; Best adds a continuous RTLS stream. Each tier provides its capabilities cumulatively. Each value lever is served None/Partial/Full by the best read mechanism the tier provides — shrink and chargeback need exit/receiving EVENTS (nothing at Good); out-of-stock, BOPIS and safety stock reach Full only with the CONTINUOUS stream. Cost rolls up from the hardware each mechanism needs. To expand to Machine Vision or BLE, add it as a capability, give each tier the capability, and fill its matrix row."
